.TH GTA2_RE 6 "" "gta2_re" "Games"
.SH NAME
gta2_re \- native port of the GTA2 decompilation
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gta2_re
.RB [ \-\-setup ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B gta2_re
plays Grand Theft Auto 2 (1999), rebuilt from the original game's code, with the game's own files.
They are not included: on the first start, choose a GTA2 folder, the game's installer or a disc image,
and its data is copied into the per-user folder.
.PP
Alt+Enter switches between window and full screen.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-setup
Show the setup again, to replace the game's data or to add its music.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/gta2_re/
(by default
.IR ~/.local/share/gta2_re/ )
The game's data, settings
.RI ( gta2_registry.ini ,
.IR gta2gl.ini )
and saves
.RI ( player/ ).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B GTA2_DIR
A GTA2 folder to play from, instead of the per-user folder.
.SH SEE ALSO
.I /usr/share/doc/gta2-re/README.md
